      "text": "```\n   SOFTWOOD (conifers: pine, spruce, fir, larch, hemlock)\n   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n   Fiber length: 2–4 mm (tracheid cells)\n   High bonding strength, high tear resistance\n   Kraft SW pulp: strength papers, grocery bags, corrugated"
